  "description": "In Hotel Renovator Simulator, you take on the role of a master renovator and manager. \nYour task is to restore an old, neglected hotel, transforming it from a pile of rubble into a five-star establishment. \nProgress from your very first room to managing a massive hotel complex with 24 unique rooms across multiple floors.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Complete Restoration: Every project begins with clearing the space. Use the trash bin to get rid of clutter and make room for your future masterpiece.\n\n- Total Transformation: You control every aspect of the finish. Use the hammer to replace old flooring with new tiles, put up fresh wallpaper, repaint walls with a roller, and upgrade ceiling panels.\n\n- Design and Furnishing: After the renovation comes the beautification stage. Choose furniture   from an extensive catalog — from classic Majesty beds to modern Chelsea sofas and Orbit tables. Arrange items in designated zones to create a cozy atmosphere for your future guests.\n\n- A Living Hotel: Your job isn’t limited to just repairs. Greet guests at the reception, hand out keys, and manage their check-ins. Happy guests are the key to your success and your main source of income.\n\n- Economy and Development: Complete restoration tasks to earn money for new materials and furniture. Invest your profits to unlock new floors and expand your business.\n\n- Professional Growth: Master your craft! Upgrade your tools (roller, hammer, spatula) to work faster and more efficiently.",
